diagnostics/program-sleep.em:2:15: this is Int, but `Program.sleep` needs a Duration
  Program.sleep(5)
                ^
Say how long with its unit, as in `Program.sleep(Duration(milliseconds: 500))`.
diagnostics/program-sleep.em:3:13: `Program.sleep` is a built-in function, so it has to be called
  const nap = Program.sleep
              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Call it with how long to pause, as in `Program.sleep(Duration(seconds: 1))`.
diagnostics/program-sleep.em:4:1: `Program.sleep` takes 1 argument, but this call passes 2
  Program.sleep(Duration(seconds: 1), 2)
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Pass how long to pause, as in `Program.sleep(Duration(seconds: 1))`.
diagnostics/program-sleep.em:7:15: `Stopwatch` is not built by calling it
  const watch = Stopwatch()
                ^^^^^^^^^
Get one from `Stopwatch.start()`.
diagnostics/program-sleep.em:8:16: `Instant` is not built by calling it
  const moment = Instant(1, 2)
                 ^^^^^^^
Get one from `Instant.now()`.
